  "name": "ci-failure-triage",
  "description": "Triage a CI / PR check failure by READING the failure body before forming any hypothesis. Triggered whenever a required check is red, a PR is BLOCKED, a merge won't land, or you're about to call a failure \"transient\", \"flaky\", \"stale\", or \"orphaned\". Prevents dismissing a real failure (e.g. real CodeQL security alerts) as noise.",
